        15,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Juliette,_Georgia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1927 a new concrete mill replaced a fire‑damaged building, making Juliette’s water‑powered gristmill the largest of its kind in the world at the time.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
